                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "\n\n公众号【有润学社考研】免费分享\n\nn 具有一致性\n\n "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "=\\frac{1}{T_{0}}\\int_{-T_{1}}^{T_{1}}x(-\\frac{1}{2}t+3)e^{-jnW_{0}t}dt"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "=e^{-jnW_{0}}F_{n}"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "\n\n梦马班作业"
